          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sosa kuli bena auti, “Ifi efyasosa Yawe umwine wa fita, Lesa wakwa Israeli aleti, ‘Nweni, mukolwe no kuluka muleluka, musuke muwe, mufilwe no kwima pa mulandu wa nkondo iyo ine nalamubushisha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga bakaana ukupoka ulukombo mu minwe yobe no kunwamo, iwe ubebefye ukuti ni Yawe umwine wa fita eusosele ukuti, ‘Ala, muli nokunwamofye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moneni, apo ine ntendekelepo ukonaula umusumba uwitwa peshina lyandi, bushe imwe muletontonkanya ukuti mulepusukako? Awe nakalya, mukalimunwa, pantu ine ndeleta inkondo ku ba pano isonde bonse.’” Ifi efyasosa Yawe umwine wa fita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.29"
            ]
          }
        }
