        {
          "text": "Pali ubo bushiku ifitumbi fya bantu abo Yawe alaswa epaye, fikalalafye ntangali ntangali ukuya shintafye no kwapelela isonde. Tapakamoneke no wakubaloosha, tapakamoneke no wakulonganya ifitumbi fyabo nangufye ukufishiika. Fyakulatulumanafye nge mina ya citindi.",
